---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Stay in Costa Blanca Cookie Policy covering consent, Google Analytics, Google Ads, Meta Pixel, TikTok Pixel and similar technologies.">
  <Header slot="header" />
  <section class="border-b border-[#D8E1E5] bg-[#0E3846] py-14 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 font-heading">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-site px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#F3C76B]">COOKIES & PRIVACY</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-[38px] sm:text-5xl lg:text-[58px] font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-tight text-white">Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base sm:text-lg leading-8 text-[#C9DDE2]">This policy explains which browser-storage technologies we use or may enable, why they are used, how long they may operate and how you can change your choice.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-[#B8D1D8]">Last updated: 30 August 2026</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white py-12 sm:py-16 lg:py-20 font-heading">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-site grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[250px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-14 lg:px-8">
      <aside class="hidden lg:block">
        <div class="sticky top-28 rounded-2xl border border-[#D7E3E6] bg-[#F7FAFA] p-4">
          <p class="px-3 pb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#D99B26]">Cookie Policy</p>
          <nav class="space-y-1" aria-label="Cookie Policy"><a href="#what" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">1. What cookies and similar technologies are</a>
<a href="#controller" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">2. Who is responsible</a>
<a href="#categories" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">3. Categories used on this website</a>
<a href="#consent" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">4. How we manage consent</a>
<a href="#necessary" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">5. Necessary technologies</a>
<a href="#google" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">6. Google Analytics and Google Ads</a>
<a href="#meta" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">7. Meta Pixel — Facebook and Instagram</a>
<a href="#tiktok" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">8. TikTok Pixel</a>
<a href="#newsletter" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">9. Newsletter, Kit and forms</a>
<a href="#third" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">10. First-party and third-party cookies</a>
<a href="#browser" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">11. Deleting cookies and browser settings</a>
<a href="#updates" class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[#405963] transition-colors hover:bg-[#EAF3F5] hover:text-[#0E3846]">12. Updates to this policy</a></nav>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <article class="min-w-0 space-y-10">
        <section id="what" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">1. What cookies and similar technologies are</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>Cookies are files or identifiers stored on or accessed from a user's device when visiting a website. They may support technical operation, preference storage, audience measurement or advertising.</p><p>The website may also use similar technologies such as <strong>localStorage</strong> and online identifiers. In this policy, “cookies” is sometimes used broadly to include these similar technologies.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="controller" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">2. Who is responsible</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p><strong>Stay in Costa Blanca</strong> is the trading name used by <strong>Matei Stelian</strong>, a self-employed professional (autónomo), NIF/NIE Z1580822Z.</p><ul><li><strong>Professional location:</strong> Villamartín, Orihuela, Alicante Province, Valencian Community, Spain, 03189</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+34624110656">+34 624 110 656</a></li><li><strong>Privacy email:</strong> <a href="mailto:privacy@stayincostablanca.com">privacy@stayincostablanca.com</a></li></ul></div>
</section>
<section id="categories" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">3. Categories used on this website</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><ul><li><strong>Necessary:</strong> technical operation, security and remembering your consent choice.</li><li><strong>Analytics:</strong> understanding website use and page performance.</li><li><strong>Marketing &amp; remarketing:</strong> campaign measurement, conversion attribution, audience creation and remarketing.</li></ul><p>Optional categories are enabled only in accordance with your choice.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="consent" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">4. How we manage consent</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>On your first visit, you can <strong>accept all</strong>, <strong>reject all</strong> or select optional categories separately.</p><p>Google Consent Mode v2 is configured so that <strong>analytics_storage</strong>, <strong>ad_storage</strong>, <strong>ad_user_data</strong> and <strong>ad_personalization</strong> default to <strong>denied</strong> before your choice.</p><p>Your preference is stored in the browser under <strong>sicb_cookie_consent_v1</strong> and is valid for a maximum of <strong>24 months</strong>. You can change or withdraw your choice at any time through the permanent <strong>“Cookie settings”</strong> button.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="necessary" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">5. Necessary technologies</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><div class="legal-table-wrap"><table class="legal-table"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>sicb_cookie_consent_v1</strong></td><td>localStorage</td><td>Stay in Costa Blanca</td><td>Stores Analytics and Marketing &amp; remarketing preferences.</td><td>Maximum 24 months unless deleted or reset sooner.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Google Tag Manager is used to manage tags. Analytics and advertising cookies belong to services loaded through that system and are managed according to consent.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="google" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">6. Google Analytics and Google Ads</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>When configured and where you have accepted the relevant category, we may use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> for statistics and <strong>Google Ads</strong> for campaign measurement and remarketing.</p><div class="legal-table-wrap"><table class="legal-table"><thead><tr><th>Cookie / identifier</th><th>Category</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Typical duration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>_ga</strong></td><td>Analytics</td><td>Distinguishes users.</td><td>Default 2 years.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>_ga_&lt;container-id&gt;</strong></td><td>Analytics</td><td>Persists session state.</td><td>Default 2 years.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>_gcl_*</strong></td><td>Marketing</td><td>Conversion measurement and attribution of advertising interactions.</td><td>May vary depending on the Google service and campaign configuration.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Where Analytics storage is denied, Google states that Analytics does not set or read Analytics cookies. Depending on the Consent Mode implementation, cookieless signals may still be sent for measurement and modelling.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="meta" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">7. Meta Pixel — Facebook and Instagram</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>When Meta Pixel is configured and you have accepted <strong>Marketing &amp; remarketing</strong>, Meta may receive information about website interactions for campaign measurement, conversion attribution and audience creation for Facebook and Instagram.</p><div class="legal-table-wrap"><table class="legal-table"><thead><tr><th>Cookie / identifier</th><th>Category</th><th>Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>_fbp</strong></td><td>Marketing</td><td>May support advertising measurement, attribution and browser identification for Meta services.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>_fbc</strong></td><td>Marketing</td><td>May be created when a visit originates from a Meta advertisement and a click identifier is present.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Meta Pixel is not necessary for the website to function.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="tiktok" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">8. TikTok Pixel</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>When TikTok Pixel is configured and you have accepted <strong>Marketing &amp; remarketing</strong>, TikTok may use identifiers for campaign measurement, conversion attribution and advertising personalisation.</p><div class="legal-table-wrap"><table class="legal-table"><thead><tr><th>Cookie / identifier</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration stated by TikTok</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>_ttp</strong></td><td>Campaign measurement and improvement and advertising personalisation.</td><td>13 months from the last time it was used.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ttcsid_ / ttcsid_&lt;pixel-code&gt;</strong></td><td>Measurement, attribution and advertising.</td><td>13 months from the last time it was used.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ttclid</strong></td><td>Identifier associated with TikTok ad interactions.</td><td>13 months from the last time it was used.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
</section>
<section id="newsletter" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">9. Newsletter, Kit and forms</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>Newsletter subscription through <strong>Kit</strong> is a separate consent flow for commercial email and does not replace consent for marketing cookies.</p><p>The contact form is transmitted through <strong>Formspree</strong>. In the current implementation, submitting the form does not require activation of a marketing-cookie category.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="third" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">10. First-party and third-party cookies</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>Some technologies are stored on <strong>stayincostablanca.com</strong>, while others may be managed by third parties such as Google, Meta or TikTok. Providers may change cookie names, lifetimes or technical behaviour over time.</p><p>The actual list may vary according to browser, consent, campaign and provider updates.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="browser" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">11. Deleting cookies and browser settings</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>In addition to the “Cookie settings” control, you can delete or block cookies and other local data through your browser settings. Clearing local storage may cause the consent panel to appear again on your next visit.</p><p>Refusing optional cookies on Stay in Costa Blanca does not prevent access to the website's main content.</p></div>
</section>
<section id="updates" class="scroll-mt-28 border-t border-[#D9E4E7] pt-9">
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight text-[#0E3846]">12. Updates to this policy</h2>
<div class="legal-copy mt-4"><p>We will update this Cookie Policy when relevant technologies are introduced or removed, purposes change, or providers or legal requirements change materially. If a change affects a previous consent choice, we may ask you to choose again.</p></div>
</section>
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#D7E3E6] bg-[#F7FAFA] p-6">
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-[#526B74]">For information about how we process personal data, please also see our Privacy Policy: <a class="font-bold text-[#397C92] underline underline-offset-4" href="/en/privacy-policy">/en/privacy-policy</a></p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .legal-copy { color:#405963; font-size:16px; line-height:1.8; }
  .legal-copy p { margin-top:1rem; }
  .legal-copy ul { margin-top:1rem; padding-left:1.25rem; list-style:disc; }
  .legal-copy li { margin-top:.45rem; }
  .legal-copy strong { color:#173F4C; font-weight:700; }
  .legal-copy a { color:#397C92; font-weight:700; text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px; }
  .legal-table-wrap { margin-top:1.25rem; overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid #D7E3E6; border-radius:14px; }
  .legal-table { width:100%; min-width:820px; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:14px; }
  .legal-table th { background:#0E3846; color:white; padding:.85rem 1rem; text-align:left; font-weight:700; }
  .legal-table td { padding:.85rem 1rem; vertical-align:top; border-top:1px solid #DEE8EA; }
  .legal-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#F8FBFB; }
</style>

